<title>CROATIA: Croatia Dec '96 M1 rose 7.8 pct, M4 4.84 pct.</title>
<headline>Croatia Dec '96 M1 rose 7.8 pct, M4 4.84 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA MONEY SUPPLY	   DEC '96    NOV '95    DEC '95</p>
<p> Monetary base (million HRK)  8,770.3    7,876.2    6,744.1</p>
<p> M1 money supply		 11,409.3   10,590.4    8,274.8</p>
<p> Broadest money M4	     36,595.5   34,910.9   24,536.9</p>
<p>NOTE -- December reserve money jumped 11.35 percent from November and M1 money supply 7.73 percent. Broadest money, or total liquid deposits, rose 4.84 percent on a monthly basis. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
